.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-mcp-call 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-mcp\-call \- Dispatch one declared method, store the response, and print the declared reduction
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten mcp call\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIserver\fR> <\fImethod\fR> [\fIparams\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Dispatch one declared method, store the response, and print the declared reduction
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIserver\fR>
The server to dispatch to, as a `[[mcp.source]]` names it
.TP
<\fImethod\fR>
The method to call
.TP
[\fIparams\fR]
The method\*(Aqs arguments, as a JSON object; omitted is `{}`
